<title>USA: National Processing names Showalter CEO.</title>
<headline>National Processing names Showalter CEO.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE, Ky. 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Processing Inc said Wednesday that Robert Showalter was named president and chief executive, effective immediately.</p>
<p>The company said Showalter succeeds Tony Holcombe, who resigned.</p>
<p>Holcombe, who stepped down late Tuesday, had been CEO and president of the company since 1994.</p>
<p>The company said Showalter had been a senior executive with National Processing's majority owner, National City Corp.</p>
</text>
